videos.desc:
Testing a new setup and process based improvisation: adjusting controls on each component in turn, round the table. 
Using: 
- modified turntable with dubplate of field recording (pigeon shed); 
- EQ + delay aux send effect line; 
- laptop running TidalCycles using percussion samples to make drones;
- reverb pedal aux send effect;
- Arturia MicroBrute monosynth
- kit built/modded signal generator + stereo delay
- Mixer (to adjust eq and FX sends)

Recorded to stereo with Zoom R16. Video: GoPro Hero3 overhead.

Made during residency at Galerie Paradise, Nantes, France. May/June 2017
